warning[use_after_free]: storage ends while a started borrower may still access it; shortest retained-borrow path shown (0 other bad paths from this start)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/tasks.jai:33:5
   |
28 |     p := make();
   |          ------ borrowed storage originated here
   ...
32 |     start(*job);
   |     ----------- borrower started here; no completion on this path
33 |     release(p);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: wait for successful borrower completion before releasing captured storage

